{title: Here I Am To Worship}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]Light of the [A]world, you stepped [Em]down into dark[G]ness, [D]open my [A]eyes, let me [G]see
[D]Beauty that [A]made this [Em]heart a[G]dore you, [D]hope of a [A]life spent with [G]you

